---
// Landing page. Six sections. The hero is staged around the author's own
// guitar; until the photo is shot, a rendered fretboard stands in, in the
// same box, so the swap is a file change (see HERO ART below).
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import Action from "../components/Action.astro";
import SpecTable from "../components/SpecTable.astro";
import DiagramPlayer from "../components/DiagramPlayer.astro";
import { fretboardSVG } from "../lib/fretboard.js";
import { pathway, phases, pathwayProgress } from "../lib/course.js";

const total = pathwayProgress();
const muting = fretboardSVG({
  fretStart: 3, fretEnd: 7,
  dots: [{ string: 3, fret: 5, root: true, label: "C" }],
  marks: [0, 1, 2, 4, 5].map((s) => ({ string: s })),
  ariaLabel: "The muting test: one note, C on the G string at the fifth fret, every other string marked silent",
});
// the third moment: the four-note line from day 1, playable. No metronome on
// this page, so the player runs at a fixed 60 BPM, two beats a note.
const line = fretboardSVG({
  fretStart: 3, fretEnd: 7,
  dots: [{ string: 3, fret: 5, label: "1" }, { string: 3, fret: 7, label: "2" }, { string: 2, fret: 5, label: "3" }, { string: 2, fret: 7, label: "4" }],
  marks: [0, 1, 4, 5].map((s) => ({ string: s })),
  playOrder: true, playBeats: 2,
  ariaLabel: "Four-note line: G string frets 5 and 7, then D string frets 5 and 7, two beats each",
});
const spec = [
  ["Phases", String(phases.length)],
  ["Days", String(total.total)],
  ["Session", "30 min"],
  ["Sessions per week", "5"],
  ["Gate rule", "fail = repeat the week"],
  ["Gear assumed", "any electric, any amp or modeller"],
  ["Cost", "free"],
];
---
<Site title={pathway.title} description="A 14-week practice path for rhythm guitarists moving from chords to being heard in the band: clean hands first, one lead line, learned in public.">
<header class="top g">
  <a class="mark" href="/"><img class="glyph" src="/mark-192.png" width="28" height="28" alt="" />Back seat to lead</a>
  <nav><a href="/path/">Path</a><a href="/log/">Log</a></nav>
</header>

<section class="hero g" aria-label="intro">
  <!-- HERO ART: when the photo exists, replace the <Fragment> below with
       <img src="/hero-guitar.jpg" width="…" height="…" fetchpriority="high" alt="…">
       and delete the .stand-in rule. Same box. -->
  <figure class="art stand-in"><img src="/hero-stand-in.png" width="1024" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" alt="Stand-in for the guitar photo: an ivory hollow-body outline with gold binding" /></figure>
  <h1>Learn to be heard in the band.</h1>
  <div class="foot">
    <p class="kicker">14&nbsp;weeks to 31&nbsp;December · 5&nbsp;×&nbsp;30&nbsp;min · learned in public</p>
    <Action variant="primary" class="cta" href="/day/1/">Start day 1</Action>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="moments" aria-label="three moments">
  <div class="g m1">
    <h2>Hands before theory.</h2>
    <p>On stage the lead lines fail for two physical reasons: strings I am not playing ring under the gain, and the picking is uneven. Two weeks of muting and metronome picking, and the same lines come out clean.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="g m2">
    <figure><Fragment set:html={muting} /></figure>
    <figcaption class="kicker">01 · The muting test. Fret C, pick once, four beats. Anything else ringing is a fail.</figcaption>
  </div>
  <div class="g m3">
    <figure><Fragment set:html={line} /></figure>
    <figcaption class="kicker">02 · Four notes, two beats each. Press play, then play along.</figcaption>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="editorial g" aria-label="what it is">
  <p>It is a daily path. Each day is one page with a timer, a metronome and the diagrams for that day. Press start, play, log it. It is not a theory course: nothing gets written here until I can play it, and no scale gets explained before the hands can hold a note clean.</p>
</section>

<section class="specs g" aria-label="specification">
  <SpecTable rows={spec} />
</section>

<section class="quote g" aria-label="from the log">
  <blockquote>
    <p>“Guitar ends up in the back seat, not heard.”</p>
    <footer class="kicker">Practice log · 21 Sep 2026 · Baseline</footer>
  </blockquote>
</section>

<section class="end g" aria-label="start">
  <Action variant="primary" class="cta" href="/day/1/">Start day 1</Action>
</section>

<footer class="chrome g">
  <p class="mono">I play rhythm guitar in a band. Notes to myself, shared.</p>
  <a class="mark small" href="/"><img class="glyph" src="/mark-192.png" width="24" height="24" alt="" />Back seat to lead</a>
</footer>
<DiagramPlayer />
</Site>

<style>
  :root{--gutter:clamp(16px, 5vw, 72px)}
  .g{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12, 1fr);column-gap:24px;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:max(var(--gutter), env(safe-area-inset-left));padding-right:max(var(--gutter), env(safe-area-inset-right))}
  .mark{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .mark .glyph{border-radius:var(--radius);mix-blend-mode:multiply}
  .mark{font-family:var(--display);font-variation-settings:"SOFT" 50,"WONK" 0;font-weight:500;font-size:var(--t-md);letter-spacing:var(--track-tight);text-decoration:none}
  .kicker{margin:0}
  .cta{min-height:48px;padding:0 24px}

  /* 1 · hero */
  .top{grid-column:1/-1;align-items:center;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:24px}
  .top .mark{grid-column:2/6}
  .top nav{grid-column:9/12;display:flex;gap:24px;justify-content:flex-end;font-size:var(--t-xs)}
  .top nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .hero{position:relative;min-height:calc(100svh - 88px);grid-template-rows:1fr auto;padding-bottom:64px;overflow:hidden}
  .hero .art{grid-column:5/12;grid-row:1;align-self:center;justify-self:center;position:relative;margin:-4svh 0 0;height:min(70svh, 800px);aspect-ratio:4/5;min-width:0}
  .hero .stand-in img{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:min(70svh, 800px);max-width:none;height:auto;margin:0;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:var(--radius);mix-blend-mode:multiply}
  .hero h1{grid-column:2/10;grid-row:1;align-self:center;position:relative;z-index:2;margin:0;font-size:var(--t-2xl);line-height:var(--lh-2xl);font-weight:500;padding:24px 0;text-wrap:balance}
  /* legibility mask: the page colour, feathered, no hard edge */
  .hero h1::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-32px -64px;z-index:-1;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 50% 50%, oklch(0.98 0.006 85 / 0.6), oklch(0.98 0.006 85 / 0) 100%)}
  .hero .foot{grid-column:2/8;grid-row:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start}

  /* 2 · three moments */
  .moments{padding-top:144px}
  .m1 h2{grid-column:2/8;margin:0;font-size:var(--t-xl);line-height:var(--lh-xl)}
  .m1 p{grid-column:2/8;font-size:var(--t-md);line-height:var(--lh-md);margin:24px 0 0;max-width:34em}
  .m2{margin-top:144px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
  .m2 figure{grid-column:5/13;margin:0 calc(-1 * var(--gutter)) 0 0}
  .m2 figure :global(svg){width:100%;max-width:none;margin:0}
  .m2 figcaption{grid-column:2/6;margin-top:24px;max-width:28em}
  .m3{margin-top:144px}
  .m3 figure{grid-column:2/8;margin:0}
  .m3 figure :global(svg){width:100%;max-width:none;margin:0}
  .m3 figure :global(.play-shape){margin:16px 0 0}
  .m3 figcaption{grid-column:2/6;margin-top:24px;max-width:28em}

  /* 3 · editorial */
  .editorial{padding-top:192px}
  .editorial p{grid-column:2/9;font-size:clamp(22px, 2vw, 28px);line-height:1.4;margin:0;max-width:none}

  /* 4 · spec */
  .specs{padding-top:144px}
  .specs :global(.spec){grid-column:2/8}

  /* 5 · pull-quote */
  .quote{padding-top:192px}
  .quote blockquote{grid-column:3/11;margin:0}
  .quote blockquote p{font-family:var(--display);font-variation-settings:"SOFT" 50,"WONK" 0;font-weight:400;font-size:var(--t-xl);line-height:var(--lh-xl);letter-spacing:var(--track-tight);margin:0;max-width:none}
  .quote footer{margin-top:24px}

  /* 6 · footer cta */
  .end{padding-top:192px;padding-bottom:192px}
  .end .cta{grid-column:2/5;justify-self:start}
  .chrome{align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:48px}
  .chrome p{grid-column:2/8;margin:0;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .chrome .mark{grid-column:10/12;justify-self:end;font-size:var(--t-base)}

  /* tablet: same asymmetry, wider spans so 8–10 columns of a 12-col grid carry the text */
  @media (min-width:721px) and (max-width:1024px){
    .hero .foot{grid-column:2/12}
    .m1 h2,.m1 p{grid-column:2/11}
    .m2 figcaption{grid-column:2/9}
    .m3 figure{grid-column:2/11}
    .m3 figcaption{grid-column:2/9}
    .editorial p{grid-column:2/12}
    .specs :global(.spec){grid-column:2/11}
    .quote blockquote{grid-column:2/12}
    .chrome p{grid-column:2/9}
    .chrome .mark{grid-column:9/12;white-space:nowrap}
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .moments{padding-top:96px}
    .m2,.m3{margin-top:96px}
    .editorial,.quote{padding-top:144px}
    .specs{padding-top:96px}
    .end{padding-top:144px;padding-bottom:144px}
  }
  @media (max-width:720px){
    /* one column: the specific desktop placements below outrank .g > *, so name them */
    .g > *, .m1 h2, .m1 p, .m2 figure, .m2 figcaption, .m3 figure, .m3 figcaption,
    .editorial p, .specs :global(.spec), .quote blockquote, .end .cta, .chrome p, .chrome .mark{grid-column:1/-1}
    .m1 p, .m2 figcaption, .m3 figcaption{max-width:none}
    .end .cta{justify-self:start;white-space:nowrap}
    .top nav{justify-content:flex-start}
    .hero{min-height:calc(100svh - 80px);padding-bottom:40px}
    .top .mark{grid-column:1/8}
    .top nav{grid-column:8/-1;justify-content:flex-end}
    .hero .art{grid-column:1/-1;justify-self:stretch;margin:0;height:62svh;aspect-ratio:auto;width:100%}
    .hero .stand-in img{width:min(62svh, 100vw)}
    .hero h1{grid-column:1/-1;align-self:end;margin-bottom:8px;padding:16px 0}
    .hero h1::before{inset:-16px -24px}
    .hero .foot{grid-column:1/-1;gap:16px}
    .m2 figure{margin:0 calc(-1 * var(--gutter))}
    .editorial p{font-size:var(--t-md)}
    .chrome .mark{justify-self:start;margin-top:16px;white-space:nowrap}
  }
</style>
